<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Industrial first interim results.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Industrial first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Consolidated   Proforma Combined</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   58.1	     45.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil		N/A</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  17.64 gain     17.64 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    73.26	    186.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		     329.37	   1,206.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A maker of pharmaceuticals, personal care products, tobacco and packaging materials. The company was incorporated in Hong Kong on January 9 and listed on May 30. The results for consolidated period are from January 9 to June 30, 1996, and for proforma combined period from January 1 to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on subscription funds for flotation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
